      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "3b4cf66bdd7bda947063dfd1c41b2892bd40e267179438c3f823eb7bd1ceff58",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "dfaa03763968287cd18d38dac1a91a22978490883b4470f6034ac33d7f922269",
      "text": "The Prompt",
      "hash": "038956745e11c5db795719153cdafdc238517adb74eeeda50004c79268b6ce92"
    },
    {
      "id": "144431814cfb21d88ad3b0524a575329a07f41f294c2919f214fdb47ea3daf26",
      "text": "The Tool",
      "hash": "33d6b1591d04918aba185b9253eba94cf2b5bfbed5b3452937903f97bd1e92c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "f17b3dcb13fa82cc71fbc084eaa5493a935ffdd5ef6c417fd7d572bb95b9dc83",
      "text": "Conclusion",
      "hash": "89db2ad881f29c18b305a20c8ed7bdffdfde49d633c27a83bd204bf9cfedaba3"
    },
    {
      "id": "e00c773547d72eeb825f84923f141c70210325cf1d058f11b605bfe521991dfa",
      "text": "Related reading",
      "hash": "89c21c36ad5ffbab7b05ced367c46013c8d7b8ddf53a8b9739b7b2545f78abee"
    },
    {
      "id": "8d099b08940f21a1146d404ef04486d6d32717fc75c4c9cd18b0ca63f4186eac",
      "text": "Anthropic just released some",
      "hash": "5796e17c59d5f5c9e3b5b708defd470026ebaaa3297904cf92d9c66121f5bea5"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f462695c1fc20de60a54b69db7fd0dbe015965fda29ef1050646031f29c5ba6",
      "text": "new research",
      "hash": "a7af20a6db006ade1945e9afddf0c0268f6599613b114bea55ef7f71a6f68055"
    },
    {
      "id": "acdebca7fd8ff9eff8a3397275963789f07607642ba47692f08e0d08caccd7ea",
      "text": "about a simple technique that can help Claude (and likely other LLMs) with tasks requiring complex problem solving.",
      "hash": "7dce0c3c75c152e304e1d57dacc76ef2e4b1355410f4705bcad185ace8b06aa4"
    },
    {
      "id": "e15fa8e950f33bc55c386175c4bc6a9f12b235a1875e2ba51ba5db4c9796b5a4",
      "text": "It's simple—you provide the LLM with a \"think\" tool it can call.",
      "hash": "c0017be2cd14c01076cc2c2edcfeb2bebdc6904ae16f35cef41dfe35967cc1e1"
    },
    {
      "id": "53300670f4f85843abea6e998ca27603b5f197343bdc282e7d0873e245d7aeae",
      "text": "(Want to know what tools are? Check out",
      "hash": "2d857bc7b2fda0512f50556b128d25e52e73aec30f1ae9e6ddeab2650c0cd12a"
    },
    {
      "id": "9f2fff9a03825125eb55c08c8edc9fb3a1f55a4e3058bbbae349da73f4d4e236",
      "text": "this guide",
      "hash": "0a3bba7069c0816eb63aaf46d266829fac588c3fcc7abf0f676829a94e4978cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "aef1e98195754883c9a5a5645f4d94e502d39ad238fca55aa326b6e1405a1914",
      "text": ".)",
      "hash": "d84e727959ff7628e4773ef6c40b9ae207850fa6863ae4b69bd4eb5757b70c2c"
    },
    {
      "id": "2fc96482dc4d2943ccdce03d5c9ad14263a0214fb5458282d1112b0456c59df6",
      "text": "The theory is that this tool is useful to give the LLM a moment to think before making a decision. It provides a structured way for the model to reflect on the information it has before proceeding.",
      "hash": "142fbb67ce6247cb0f0b0e13d4291ea3eba80a484ebb6886674a563f817b4e31"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f1b70ba16bc0204847c8e65738e26e4c515e7047788fa0509a18dd411b6706d",
      "text": "This allows the LLM to save important information in its context, which can be used later to make better decisions. It echoes familiar concepts like ReAct and Reflexion.",
      "hash": "f25a3acdef46a6b74b20774a9872ae404413632d01d3b205f55b0aefd05f5055"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd310f3509a21f6fde76988a218e25e46b06b6c4107734e4df88cc58e40bf3c1",
      "text": "Let's try implementing it.",
      "hash": "6c6baf9afabd8ecfdd22ce44467931c627a06311250c3e7e8429445533b3854c"
    },
    {
      "id": "45f268682dab7f4a16f67efb07d83e16c5873cba3178ca75cd9cce3b216c8fa2",
      "text": "We're first going to pull out a",
      "hash": "07018b9d32171550c8cabec6e1c7b472e3b046f05a39fc7dce90e05a6c090e38"
    },
    {
      "id": "fa70e22d25b437c92a3895bbd14ddc1f6fab70dbe49a04837b961cbd97302305",
      "text": "variable, which will serve as the tool's description:",
      "hash": "a6645bc8f622206f7e11880d3d2c540b7de6654383bf5b5eb5317b7864dd2c90"
    },
    {
      "id": "ecda429d099748f7d8bc82d017d2973b0f7b8504b981b2bcce721a51ec0264d8",
      "text": "This text is pulled from Anthropic's article.",
      "hash": "ce3b2c0b5c83610db4b3051cd42c7c3db344de5bef20a8ad6af62d5e5e933fef"
    },
    {
      "id": "477189b32dda0d6933829177d607e839c16630ff3bb350b4a7c720b10a51ecea",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "631c914a1a06c24cd188f3ea914ceeef16842a637e39e746531a1b0e2dce6feb",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "7327b353ec7cf214c466189670dff5bf38ee58b73854e24f66f180a7a3548ac7",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "d7e216509204d83d97825292e7db114b453e803282d8812b9fd6a59e91cbf60e",
      "text": "Let's start with a",
      "hash": "f8643a0bc34cfd685ee08015d6a70087853fd028bf6822eacd5ba0963a377588"
    },
    {
      "id": "1830940619b301dffd52c809f36c97b04201233ad8b297a415b3e857eafc0d41",
      "text": "call from the AI SDK:",
      "hash": "ee28a483d7e70af346159efbade79690feadea7e621f668ae1ea385b5995b758"
    },
    {
      "id": "e78ca0895031f3dbd1bcc0649be41355dbb890c9f0e0102a247d2d0e61580b8e",
      "text": "Let's use Claude 3.7 and set a",
      "hash": "f24db38059e4e842445e4b45322d4f782b41c9b170a06ae4200eb55675c3294b"
    },
    {
      "id": "c44efa07bf6cb06560b20c9dc506e79b7ff47000f6d458484e4d76b4f452f2e6",
      "text": "of 10:",
      "hash": "291cbeb10b833d99c23ecfd2b1844bae9747023525440744b1b157522e11371d"
    },
    {
      "id": "56c4f2469935d66de82c32e7f70f59bf721a126320cbfbd74fb93b3f41f9afd8",
      "text": "Next, let's pass it a tool called",
      "hash": "79bd0a4de24fc2a9e9a8176dc504c4c29933073c16284a7f734966f5865a0a04"
    },
    {
      "id": "714c45841e4604d3c2b34983a43302a5a332132d381c324921de11bb38da49cf",
      "text": ", passing the",
      "hash": "162395d4a46cc3a8ff4d405675ea497928eff73927f2b786b6e93827b0f8fd5f"
    },
    {
      "id": "c295e8e3d1ed689724c701575d8f60844d0fcdbbbf4188fe207db671dcbd8917",
      "text": "we defined earlier:",
      "hash": "945f141929d33a17d12a4d1f221a92f311d8daab28a2d41fe6c84dd8a0f32d0f"
    },
    {
      "id": "3c1f56fc1071ee67e6ba5c5f98f194f8cf32369d3d6b7b3904277231cb43a5e9",
      "text": "We'll next add a",
      "hash": "34762971d6dd3ca9f3f6fe6ca01fe8e921658e7b3b1b9c02631e178897a7375e"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f038c5b550e46ebc7e3e5c398b2de3eac72f94321a8ecb2afe1d1d0014af21c",
      "text": "object to the",
      "hash": "726d560406ba6728c6e0125962351a904c3cee3da3ae91efa2b43c31331d26e2"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2af61cea4062bf394c0cd27df116508314279cce2859beb3175167d5feba900",
      "text": "tool.",
      "hash": "6aed665815d7845b7d01b2c6821d304a6ee8c28862bee6bd30eb37ece2273a4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "75db6f1c8a6c6d1992e2ef51d7f910d1a3ace252155567fbe7b5bf7e25cdd54d",
      "text": "This object will contain a",
      "hash": "2843f5e49b1d679b0b522cfcd8de685f682948d24142e814206f01f4c2a61699"
    },
    {
      "id": "23a785fcdac283a9ac59d4d7a29e868c5a589398907dad66d25fdb6ce9b95a9f",
      "text": "field, which is a string. The description is also taken from the article.",
      "hash": "1274ec2cb8069498e00ac278b21f259ac7ccd8a32eb0983a1663d93555e2f235"
    },
    {
      "id": "ad8b65cafbc5bfa1239ebac69220a032c61ef3e475f887f07004393dc94622ed",
      "text": "Finally, let's add an",
      "hash": "2f47e314e699a70613475e3cf8807d730b4376f5fa1a2a6e6bf70b77f1aa9927"
    },
    {
      "id": "219f15b9e4706512afd44f7a85d79685cea732910a6a24f764a0834e8433ccc9",
      "text": "function to the",
      "hash": "92e225e735096c84865de7733edcdb16d588f27cd1b28a630fa0e8ef036d4abf"
    },
    {
      "id": "d189848700a62c514ac9d639ff3bcf0661e8d5d95076373469395537d342a409",
      "text": "This function won't do anything—it'll simply return the",
      "hash": "e0af38964c5ff810e45538449ef1926090487e0dbf6afc52afc85e810cf7ff9b"
    },
    {
      "id": "824147e11337e2aabc7c83528ccdf24c6666967e428e8d283280b2229aa1ac12",
      "text": "passed to it.",
      "hash": "52d86cba4be91d6c079c3129f0747f565aa9f8117ba2a6b9b0c3daa8d86be1d4"
    },
    {
      "id": "eec418bf0508eb35469597511fa5175e959968cee60cbc457e3d6e3f4b7c2d73",
      "text": "This then gets saved in the context, and in future iterations of the model, it can be used to make better decisions.",
      "hash": "499f32b67009507cd6acbd5502a44b864beb0eb2672e79cff31ad72712edc1ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "3dbd41fdc709532dc268fbc33db26c8ae6720dfc6c4f272444e22392df9a1167",
      "text": "And that's it! We've implemented the \"think\" tool in Claude 3.7 Sonnet.",
      "hash": "d561029065e90e0a0e796044d15b8a606bfe80232cf6acb40af40fc2ceb1e456"
    },
    {
      "id": "c32ce7aef73da5140295d125d0bc0e6e64fc6feaf516803eeca54c028161e878",
      "text": "This is a really useful technique for applying in certain situations. Anthropic recommends it for \"complex tasks requiring policy adherence and reasoning in long chains of tool calls.\" It's a simple addition to your LLM implementation that can yield meaningful improvements in just a few lines of code.",
      "hash": "0ae460fb4baf31717c2dc5b56f84fd55cca5ba3dd2f02cc46da7a0cf69843764"
    },
    {
      "id": "04f05338de105d9f130ef182b6f87fb5313f0f132a6bc2870d0863ec6d5c595e",
      "text": "Happy experimenting!",
      "hash": "a4c6920ef00cc1abce3eba2b4bef820e8347d4cf95ac034ef9d28d7d0a22f050"
    },
    {
      "id": "ecaa1e11b24d640796be858e8451025c63f560f0cd782e52125fb4671a397578",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
    {
      "id": "c750d9ca692787c553511c69bccdc190d92cc4d62eefb26c9a0e19551506fbf4",
      "text": "Share on Bluesky",
      "hash": "08863b88a05c60410c38c4caec5bc72535b0f01793ce6cee9171b6358b2c11da"
    },
    {
      "id": "45e215ad727152cdb50a0fb0acfcb1ec4193f9fae9b2f925fc9988d8e38f7a75",
      "text": "Share on LinkedIn",
      "hash": "ab87c050148bd1d372e3ec3483a606127a7a1faec0f1ca5543bc3465d84fe6c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "58e3593ec9e3294aae725547c989e311da3f2ff5fea157f6e72d0b3d69eb98ca",
      "text": "Copy URL",
      "hash": "b26d1037f1c2da31a0296d915982f12049f91bfedb998b105ce967b73a796699"
    },
    {
      "id": "75b9fd603cd05cc2209bd243aedc20cb0710031babc53feead549d8b525bf9f3",
      "text": "Video",
      "hash": "d534be829e32196b4d1e53b67103cf1e376b1d60071857572598c196abfefbc6"
    },
    {
      "id": "2dace4bd37b186a4435b31d8866a8712e2c98af52cadb7be026c1ee5f0310da1",
      "text": "What Are Tools?",
